"默认1小时，可选1分钟至24小时。中断等待计入本次时限；恢复不会重新计时，24小时不是持续录音保证。" = "Default: 1 hour. Choose 1 minute to 24 hours. Interruptions count toward the original limit. Resuming does not restart the timer; a 24-hour limit does not guarantee continuous capture.";
"默认60分钟，范围1–180分钟。分段转写保留时间轴；后台限制仍然生效。" = "Default: 60 minutes. Range: 1–180 minutes. Chunked transcription preserves timestamps. Background restrictions still apply.";
"默认波动阈值：偏离近期中位数至少20次/分且至少25%；至少5个新鲜样本；冷却3分钟。这是待校准规则，不是医学标准。" = "Default trigger: at least 20 bpm and 25% away from the recent median, at least 5 fresh samples, and a 3-minute cooldown. This is a tunable heuristic, not a medical standard.";
